---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Tentang Kami — Central CAD Indonesia (Afiliasi CAD Solution)"
  description="Profil resmi Central CAD Indonesia, penyedia solusi software CAD & 3D CAM berlisensi permanen resmi di Indonesia. Terafiliasi langsung dengan jaringan CAD Solution (cadsolution.co.id)."
>
  <Navbar active="about" />

  <main>
    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-900 text-white text-center relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-900/20 to-slate-900 pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 space-y-4">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-300 border border-blue-400/30">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" />
          </svg>
          AUTHORIZED PARTNER ZWSOFT INDONESIA
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          Tentang Central CAD Indonesia
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Mitra strategis industri manufaktur, konsultan rekayasa, dan konstruksi dalam pengadaan software CAD &amp; 3D CAM legal permanen tanpa beban langganan tahunan.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Content Section -->
    <section class="py-16 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">

        <!-- Afiliasi CAD Solution Card -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900 to-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 text-white shadow-xl border border-blue-800/40">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
            <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-4">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-bold bg-amber-400/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-400/30 uppercase tracking-wider">
                Bagian Dari Jaringan CAD Solution
              </span>
              <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">
                Kemitraan Resmi dengan CAD Solution &amp; PT Hetra Teknologi Indonesia
              </h2>
              <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                Central CAD (<a href="https://centralcad.id" class="text-amber-400 underline hover:text-amber-300">centralcad.id</a>) beroperasi di bawah naungan <strong>PT Hetra Teknologi Indonesia</strong> dan terafiliasi resmi dengan portal edukasi serta pengadaan CAD terkemuka Indonesia di <a href="https://cadsolution.co.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 font-semibold underline hover:text-amber-300">cadsolution.co.id</a>.
              </p>
              <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                Kolaborasi ini didedikasikan untuk menghadirkan kepastian hukum lisensi software desain teknik, transparansi harga resmi, serta jaminan layanan purna jual profesional langsung dari distributor resmi ZWSOFT di Indonesia.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row lg:flex-col gap-3">
              <a
                href="https://cadsolution.co.id"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-slate-950 font-bold text-sm shadow-md transition-all text-center"
              >
                <span>Kunjungi CADSolution.co.id</span>
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
                </svg>
              </a>
              <a
                href="/harga"
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-semibold text-sm border border-white/20 transition-all text-center"
              >
                <span>Lihat Katalog Lisensi</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Visi & Nilai Kami -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">100% Legal &amp; Terpercaya</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Setiap unit lisensi ZWCAD &amp; ZW3D yang kami sediakan memiliki sertifikat kepemilikan bernomor resmi terdaftar di principal ZWSOFT, dilengkapi faktur pajak dan perjanjian lisensi resmi untuk perusahaan Anda.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Efisiensi Biaya Signifikan</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Skema lisensi permanen (perpetual) membebaskan perusahaan dari biaya sewa tahunan AutoCAD yang terus meningkat. Menghemat pengeluaran investasi software IT engineering hingga 70%.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M18.364 5.636l-3.536 3.536m0 5.656l3.536 3.536M9.172 9.172L5.636 5.636m3.536 9.192l-3.536 3.536M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-5 0a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Dukungan Engineer Teknis</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Tim Application Engineer kami siap mendampingi proses implementasi, uji coba kompatibilitas file .DWG, migrasi script LISP, demo on-site di pabrik, hingga pelatihan bersertifikasi untuk drafter Anda.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Solusi Software Kami -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-12 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-8">
          <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
              Ekosistem Solusi Software yang Kami Dukung
            </h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base">
              Menjawab tantangan desain rekayasa mulai dari drafting 2D harian hingga manufaktur CNC 5-axis mutakhir.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-3">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">ZWCAD 2026 (2D/3D CAD)</h3>
                <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-blue-100 text-blue-800">Standard / Pro / MFG</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Software CAD 2D/3D alternatif utama AutoCAD dengan kompatibilitas format .DWG 100%. Interface, shortcut command, dan format font/dimensi identik sehingga drafter dapat langsung bekerja tanpa masa adaptasi.
              </p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-1 pt-1">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  <span>Buka file DWG raksasa instan dengan akselerasi multi-core CPU &amp; GPU</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  <span>Mendukung LISP, VBA, .NET, dan Flexblock cerdas</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-3">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">ZW3D 2026 (All-in-One 3D CAD/CAM)</h3>
                <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-amber-100 text-amber-800">CAD + CAM + Mold</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Platform terintegrasi desain parametrik 3D, perancangan cetakan (mold design), dan pembuatan toolpath permesinan CNC (2-axis hingga 5-axis milling &amp; turning) dalam satu software tanpa konversi data.
              </p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-1 pt-1">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  <span>Kernel solid-surface hybrid Overdrive canggih</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  <span>Simulasi toolpath real-time &amp; proteksi tabrakan mesin CNC</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Kantor & Layanan Operasional -->
        <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-12 text-white border border-slate-800 space-y-6">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Kantor &amp; Layanan Operasional</h2>
              <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Kami melayani kebutuhan instalasi, migrasi sistem, dan pelatihan teknis di kantor Anda maupun secara daring untuk seluruh wilayah Indonesia.
              </p>
              <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
                  </svg>
                  <span><strong>Alamat:</strong> Plaza Summarecon Bekasi Lantai 6, Jl. Bulevar Ahmad Yani, Kota Bekasi, Jawa Barat 17142</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
                  </svg>
                  <span><strong>Hotline WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="https://wa.me/6281912244662" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold hover:underline">0819-1224-4662</a></span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                  </svg>
                  <span><strong>Email:</strong> sales@centralcad.id / agus@hetratekno.com</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/60 space-y-4">
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Butuh Presentasi atau Pengujian File Perusahaan?</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Tim teknis kami dapat mendemokan pengujian file gambar kerja .DWG perusahaan Anda secara langsung, baik melalui pertemuan tatap muka di kantor/pabrik Anda maupun via Zoom / Microsoft Teams.
              </p>
              <div class="pt-2">
                <a
                  href="/hubungi-kami"
                  class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold text-xs transition-colors"
                >
                  <span>Jadwalkan Demo Teknis</span>
                  <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
                  </svg>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
